、(笑)\n \n 難しい、、顔交換、、\n \n \n 今日お越し下さった皆さん、ゆっくり休んでくださいね(。・о・。)！\n \n \n おやすみなさい☆\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ09VCEFEDBBAJ56GQD7RTH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n 加藤史帆"}],"source":"archive"}}